+- No implementation during this scout/proposal stage.
+- No broad command/undo/persistence redesign, backend stance decision, app-shell service extraction, package/tooling change, validation-platform work, docs/spec cleanup, or debug placeholder deletion.
+- No broad 3D scene/OrbitControls redesign unless a reviewed later cycle selects it.
+- Do not touch forbidden secret/config files.
 
-## Wave-plan edit status
+## Validation requirements for the future implementation wave
 
